<metadata><name>Galičica trail H-6</name><desc>H-6 is one of Galičica National Park's easier and shorter hiking trails. It runs 5.7 km from Konjsko to above Elshani (1,469 m), climbing about 426 m and descending 39 m in the direction drawn, between 1,085 m and 1,507 m. https://galicica.finereli.com/trails/h-6/</desc><link href="https://galicica.finereli.com/"><text>galicica.finereli.com</text></link><copyright author="NP Galičica (trail lines), OpenStreetMap contributors (places, G-6)"><license>https://galicica.finereli.com/about/#license</license></copyright></metadata>
